        <mxCell id="fluent" value="&lt;b&gt;Fluent Bit 4.2.8 · 256MiB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;host network · Docker 파일 read-only&lt;br&gt;catus-app-v2 프로젝트만 허용&lt;br&gt;app → data-api 이름 매핑&lt;br&gt;네 서버·nginx 외 컨테이너 drop&lt;br&gt;JSON parse / raw·nginx 정제·마스킹&lt;br&gt;fluent_bit_state: tail.db + 버퍼&lt;br&gt;Loki 원본 + S3 복제본을 따로 전송&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;tail → Lua → parser → Lua → outputs&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f5f7;strokeColor=#607583;fontColor=#172b3a;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=20;spacingRight=14;spacingBottom=12;">
